---
// Solutions.astro
---

<section id="solutions" class="py-16 sm:py-24 md:py-32 border-t border-subtle bg-surface-1/30 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16 sm:mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="w-6 h-[2px] bg-[#ff4500]"></span>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-dim uppercase">Core Solutions</span>
        <span class="w-6 h-[2px] bg-[#ff4500]"></span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-main leading-tight mb-6">
        Every Great Message Starts With a Great Hook.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-muted font-normal max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Whether on a social feed, a video player, or an enterprise landing page, we engineer high-impact hooks tailored to each medium.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 6 Solutions Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Solution 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-1 border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11 5.882V19.24a1.76 1.76 0 01-3.417.592l-2.147-6.15M18 13a3 3 0 100-6M5.436 13.683A4.001 4.001 0 017 6h1.832c4.1 0 7.625-1.234 9.168-3v14c-1.543-1.766-5.067-3-9.168-3H7a3.988 3.988 0 01-1.564-.317z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-main mb-3 group-hover:text-[#ff4500] transition-colors">
            Marketing & Advertising Hooks
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Ad openers and headline concepts designed to halt ad fatigue, cut through paid clutter, and compel audiences to engage.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-subtle text-xs text-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Paid Media & Campaigns</span>
          <span class="text-[#ff4500]">High Impact</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-1 border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 11.5V14m0-2.5v-6a1.5 1.5 0 113 0m-3 6a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0v2a7.5 7.5 0 0015 0v-5a1.5 1.5 0 00-3 0m-6-3V11m0-5.5v-1a1.5 1.5 0 013 0v1m0 0V11m0-5.5a1.5 1.5 0 013 0v3m0 0V11" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-main mb-3 group-hover:text-[#ff4500] transition-colors">
            Instagram & Social Media Hooks
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed font-normal">
            First-frame text overlays, carousel cover copy, and feed captions crafted specifically for rapid algorithmic scrolling.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-subtle text-xs text-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Organic & Social</span>
          <span class="text-[#ff4500]">Feed Stopping</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-1 border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-main mb-3 group-hover:text-[#ff4500] transition-colors">
            Video Opening Hooks
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed font-normal">
            First 3-second spoken lines and kinetic on-screen hooks engineered to preserve drop-off curves and hold viewer watch time.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-subtle text-xs text-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Short & Long Form Video</span>
          <span class="text-[#ff4500]">3-Sec Retention</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution 4 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-1 border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-main mb-3 group-hover:text-[#ff4500] transition-colors">
            Website & Landing Page Headlines
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Above-the-fold value propositions and hero headlines that articulate immediate relevance and eradicate bounce rates.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-subtle text-xs text-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Digital Real Estate</span>
          <span class="text-[#ff4500]">Clarity First</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution 5 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-1 border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-main mb-3 group-hover:text-[#ff4500] transition-colors">
            Product & Business Messaging
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Core positioning statements and differentiated angles that separate your offer from saturated, copycat markets.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-subtle text-xs text-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Positioning & Offers</span>
          <span class="text-[#ff4500]">Differentiation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution 6 -->
      <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-surface-card border border-subtle hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition-all duration-200 group flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-1 border border-subtle flex items-center justify-center text-[#ff4500] mb-6 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-main mb-3 group-hover:text-[#ff4500] transition-colors">
            Personal Branding Hooks
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted leading-relaxed font-normal">
            Thought leadership openings and narrative hooks that establish distinctive individual authority and spark organic conversations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-subtle text-xs text-dim flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Authority & Voice</span>
          <span class="text-[#ff4500]">Resonance</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

